# 2026-08-10 21:23:05.608068
+Modify ONLY src/App.css.
+
+Do NOT modify App.tsx.
+Do NOT modify services/ai.ts.
+Do NOT modify Tauri files.
+Do NOT change the existing layout or functionality.
+
+The current React component uses these actual CSS classes:
+
+.composer
+.message
+.message.user
+.message.ai
+.message-name
+.agent-activity
+.center
+.chat
+.left-sidebar
+.right-sidebar
+
+Improve the typography and composer:
+
+1. Composer
+- Make .composer approximately 68px tall.
+- Give it 12px rounded corners.
+- Increase horizontal and vertical padding.
+- Make the placeholder text 15-16px.
+- Make composer buttons 40px × 40px.
+- Make the send button visually prominent with the existing purple accent.
+- Keep the composer at the bottom of the center panel.
+
+2. Chat text
+- .message font-size: 15px.
+- line-height: 1.6.
+- Increase spacing between messages.
+- Make AI/user text easier to read.
+- Keep secondary text muted.
+
+3. Message names
+- 13px.
+- Slightly brighter purple/accent color.
+- Add a little spacing below the name.
+
+4. Agent activity
+- 13-14px.
+- Improve readability without making it oversized.
+
+5. Do not change the existing dark theme.
+6. Do not introduce gradients.
+7. Keep the existing purple accent.
+8. Do not create new components.
+9. Do not use !important unless absolutely necessary.
+10. Preserve the existing responsive three-panel layout.
+
+After editing run:
+
+npm run build
+
+Fix any errors until the build succeeds.

